# TESTS
### POST with no name
POST http://localhost:5103/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "",
    "genre": "Platformer",
    "price": 59.99,
    "releaseDate": "2023-10-20"
}

### POST with a name too long
POST http://localhost:5103/games
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "PlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformerPlatformer",
    "genre": "Platformer",
    "price": 59.99,
    "releaseDate": "2023-10-20"
}

### PUT with a price out of range
PUT http://localhost:5103/games/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Street Fighter II Turbo",
    "genre": "Fighting",
    "price": 119.99,
    "releaseDate": "1992-07-15"
}